ngetragen, plausibel wäre:</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-3-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>(wie 2. Strophe).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-4fbe2da8-85fc-4182-96d6-f5205c842ee9" endid="#m-585dc7a0-45ef-4ad7-9c73-afca659b3597" corresp="#m-comment-4"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-4-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-4-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-1369163c-829c-44f9-892b-941eb38ef51b" endid="#m-1cf45e82-4caf-4ba9-b29b-245b7a8fe3d3"><table><tr><td><rend>((nunciatum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>metrisch plausibler: ((annunciatum)) (wie ((Pa 4880)) und [[Young]] II 16).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-db62f33d-d03a-4bf9-9832-a3c39a4f3016" endid="#m-db62f33d-d03a-4bf9-9832-a3c39a4f3016" corresp="#m-comment-6"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-6-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>mi-Zeichen.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-795a9cd2-76a1-4107-8eee-aa24a3c8e40c" endid="#m-795a9cd2-76a1-4107-8eee-aa24a3c8e40c" corresp="#m-comment-7"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-7-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>mi-Zeichen.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-1582e78f-b4ba-4606-b0c8-daa8b270d875" endid="#m-9aa235a7-1575-46b6-a8fd-ef4c09b48203"><table><tr><td><rend>((et dicamus))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>metrisch plausibler: ((et dicamus et dicamus)) (wie [[Young]] II 17); die Melodie ließe sich aus der 1. Strophe gewinnen.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-7f16fa4b-fd40-4065-887c-014ec56c9552" endid="#m-4c573465-1c64-4b8c-89cb-9e0513c79b4c" type="emendation" corresp="#m-comment-9"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-9-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>(wie Strophe 2)</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-9-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-2ffcb6ae-9597-4204-9dc5-b859b0accab7" endid="#m-